      "Released": true,
      "Comment": "1st dungeon of the expedition. 5th dungeon overall.\r\n\r\nLarge, open floors without any real rooms. Has pokemon that tend to form herds or packs, so that when encounters are made, a good chance it’s a lot of pokemon moving together that’ll work together.\r\n-Pokemon to add in the future if they get sprites: Blitzle, replace stantler probably\r\n-purp kec shop stocks Low Tier TMs",
